(test_uuid,'Listening · Classroom Practice','choice','What is the main purpose of the announcement?',null,'Starting Wednesday morning, the North Campus bus will not stop in front of the science building because the road is being repaired. Until Friday evening, passengers should use the temporary stop beside the east parking lot. The bus schedule will not change, but walking from the science building to the temporary stop takes about five minutes. Please plan to arrive early. Normal service is expected to resume on Saturday.','["To recruit new laboratory assistants", "To explain a temporary bus-stop change", "To advertise a city museum", "To cancel afternoon classes"]'::jsonb,'"To explain a temporary bus-stop change"'::jsonb,null,'published'::public.content_status,36,'original','User-supplied TOEFL iBT 2026–Aligned Classroom Mock Form A; README declares all items original and not official ETS items.',now()),
